   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JOR Computer strategy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JOR Datoriseringsstrategi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det jordanska energibolaget NEPCO har nyligen delats upp i tre olika bolag. Transmissionsbolaget, NEPCO, kommer ocks&#xe5; att bli ansvarigt f&#xf6;ratt tillhandah&#xe5;lla datortj&#xe4;nster till alla tre bolagen. En ny och avancerad datoriseringsfilosofi kommer att implementeras hos NEPCO genom insatsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Jordanian National Energy Power Company has recently been split up into three different companies. The transmission company, NEPCO, will also be responsible for comupter services for all of the three companies. A new and advanced computerization philosophy will be imp- lemented through the project.</narrative>
  </description>
